{
    "title": "Beat Maker Pro - DJ Drum Pad",
    "description": "Beat Maker Pro - DJ Drum Pad is the easiest way to become a DJ beat maker in no time! Make a beat, groove to music, and play with drum pad machine!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 You create music beats?\ud83c\udfb6 \r\n\r\nMeet your new favorite drum pad machine to make music and create groove beats like a real DJ. Mix loops, record all your music with our intuitive pads and feel the rhythm! This 24 groovepad drum app will help you to create songs from all genres (dubstep, trap, EDM, hip-hop...), and to become a beatbox maker that masters dpm. If you do EDM & Dubstep melodies or music, you will love the rhythm groovepad, the drums and beatmaking lessons. Learn how to make a beat easily!\r\n\r\nWith Beat Maker Pro you can:\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Create drum music, melodies, and rhythms \r\n\ud83c\udfb9  Make a beat and play famous songs of all genres\r\n\ud83c\udfa7  Learn beatbox and become a music machine maker pro\r\n\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f  Make drums groove like a DJ with the 24 drum pad - dpm\r\n\ud83c\udfb5  Impress with the 24 drum pad machine for star beats, music and groove\r\n\r\nWith Beat Maker Pro, get the best music lessons, be closer to the rhythm and melodies you like: you might become the DJ king who masters the art of drums. You will have a studio in your pocket to remix a song, make a beat, and be a music maker - anywhere, anytime.\r\n\r\nHave any suggestion regarding the app? Our support team is ready to help at support-drumpad@mwmapps.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Beat Maker Pro - DJ Drum Pad is the easiest way to become a DJ beat maker in no time! Make a beat, groove to music, and play with drum pad machine!<br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 You create music beats?\ud83c\udfb6 <br><br>Meet your new favorite drum pad machine to make music and create groove beats like a real DJ. Mix loops, record all your music with our intuitive pads and feel the rhythm! This 24 groovepad drum app will help you to create songs from all genres (dubstep, trap, EDM, hip-hop...), and to become a beatbox maker that masters dpm. If you do EDM &amp; Dubstep melodies or music, you will love the rhythm groovepad, the drums and beatmaking lessons. Learn how to make a beat easily!<br><br>With Beat Maker Pro you can:<br>\ud83c\udfb6 Create drum music, melodies, and rhythms <br>\ud83c\udfb9  Make a beat and play famous songs of all genres<br>\ud83c\udfa7  Learn beatbox and become a music machine maker pro<br>\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f  Make drums groove like a DJ with the 24 drum pad - dpm<br>\ud83c\udfb5  Impress with the 24 drum pad machine for star beats, music and groove<br><br>With Beat Maker Pro, get the best music lessons, be closer to the rhythm and melodies you like: you might become the DJ king who masters the art of drums. You will have a studio in your pocket to remix a song, make a beat, and be a music maker - anywhere, anytime.<br><br>Have any suggestion regarding the app? Our support team is ready to help at support-drumpad@mwmapps.com.",
